{"id":"9ca697ca4459a05e","group":"62","path":"62/62-df-ACA.md","title":"Arithmetical Comprehension Schema","display":"df-ACA — Arithmetical Comprehension Schema","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-df-ACA","aliases":["62-df-ACA"],"display":"df-ACA — Arithmetical Comprehension Schema","depends_on":["[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","[[62-df-Comprehension]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.3.2, III.1.2","source_pages":[7,105],"source_pdf_pages":[25,123]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-df-ACA"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-df-ACA</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ACA — Arithmetical Comprehension Schema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7a06a0db4bcea18\" href=\"?note=e7a06a0db4bcea18\" title=\"62-df-Comprehension\">62-df-Comprehension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Definitions I.3.2, III.1.2"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>7</span><span>105</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>25</span><span>123</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\">\\(\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8535a715d3193fba\" href=\"?note=8535a715d3193fba\" title=\"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy\">62-df-AnalyticHierarchy</a>；理解模式生成算子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7a06a0db4bcea18\" href=\"?note=e7a06a0db4bcea18\" title=\"62-df-Comprehension\">62-df-Comprehension</a>。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}\\)</span> 是所引用上游的生成算子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ACA}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ACA}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ACA}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ACA}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>无集合量词，但允许集合参数。是公理句子集合；名称 ACA 在本原子专指理解模式，不指加强归纳后的其他系统。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Definitions I.3.2, III.1.2；纸面页 7, 105；PDF 页 25, 123。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"e7a06a0db4bcea18","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Comprehension]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-AnalyticHierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"8535a715d3193fba","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；理解模式生成算子见 [[62-df-Comprehension]]。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Comprehension","status":"resolved","id":"e7a06a0db4bcea18","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)$ 见 [[62-df-AnalyticHierarchy]]；理解模式生成算子见 [[62-df-Comprehension]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}ACA}\\vdash\\;\\mathrm{ACA}(S_2)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Comp}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{Arith}(S_2)).","display":true}],"bytes":1043,"backlinks":[{"id":"35af454d9caa8c9d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"见 [[62-df-basic-axioms]] 的 $\\mathrm Q_2$、[[62-df-set-induction]] 的 $\\mathrm I_{\\mathrm{set}}$、[[62-df-ACA]] 的 $\\mathrm{ACA}(S_2)$。"},{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-df-ACA|Arithmetical Comprehension Schema]]"}],"outgoing":["8535a715d3193fba","e7a06a0db4bcea18"]}